/**
 * Source-neutral Router V2 lifecycle contract.
 *
 * Contract-derived profile keys, typehashes, ABI artifacts and release hashes
 * enter this module only through an exact frozen profile binding. The checked-in
 * target catalog contains no such binding and is therefore incapable of
 * producing an executable permit. This module has no signer, broadcaster,
 * deployment, Website or Indexer implementation.
 */

